you want, then resume.

9
00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.300
We won't leave long silent gaps in the recording.

10
00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:31.370
Begin with the person’s experience, then explore communication, responsibility, participation

11
00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:35.530
and improvement. Every part includes recorded guidance, a visible transcript,

