00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.780
case details and other private information out of learning notes.

18
00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:59.010
This curriculum connects the National CLAS Standards to individual work.

19
00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:03.790
It does not replace agency requirements, specialist guidance or approval

20
00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:07.850
processes. Identify what you can change and where coordination is

21
00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:08.110
